"en": [
"CHAPTER ONE: SOVEREIGNTY OF",
"THE PEOPLE OF RWANDA AND",
"SUPREMACY",
"OF",
"THE",
"CONSTITUTION",
"Article One:",
"sovereignty",
"Source",
"of",
"national",
"(1) All power emanates from the people",
"of Rwanda and is exercised in",
"accordance with this Constitution.",
"(2) No individual or group of people",
"may arrogate to themselves the",
"exercise of power.",
"(3) National sovereignty belongs to the",
"people of Rwanda who themselves",
"exercise it through referendum,",
"ordinary",
"elections",
"or",
"their",
"representatives.",
"Article 2: Suffrage",
"(1) Suffrage is universal and equal for",
"all Rwandans.",
"27",
"Official Gazette n° Special of 04/08/2023",
"(2) All Rwandans, both women and",
"men, fulfilling the requirements",
"provided for by law, have the right",
"to vote and to be elected.",
"(3) Suffrage is direct or indirect, and",
"secret, unless this Constitution or",
"other laws provide otherwise.",
"(4) An organic law governing elections",
"determines",
"conditions",
"and",
"modalities for conducting elections.",
"Article 3: Supremacy of the Constitution",
"(1) The Constitution is the supreme law",
"of the country.",
"(2) A law, a decision or an act contrary",
"to this Constitution is without effect.",
"CHAPTER",
"RWANDA",
"II:",
"REPUBLIC",
"28",
"OF",
"Official Gazette n° Special of 04/08/2023",
"Article 4: The Republic",
"(1) The Rwandan State is an",
"independent, sovereign, democratic,",
"social and secular Republic.",
"(2) The founding principle of the",
"Republic",
"of",
"Rwanda",
"is:",
"“Government of the people of",
"Rwanda, by the people of Rwanda",
"and for the people of Rwanda.”",
"Article 5: Territory of Rwanda and",
"administrative entities",
"(1) Rwanda’s territory comprises areas",
"covered by land, rivers, lakes and",
"airspace located within the borders",
"of the Republic of Rwanda.",
"(2) In determining Rwanda’s territory,",
"consideration is given to Rwanda’s",
"boundaries",
"as",
"defined",
"by",
"international treaties ratified by",
"Rwanda, and Rwandan laws.",
"(3) The territory of Rwanda is divided",
"into",
"administrative",
"entities",
"determined by an organic law that",
"29",
"Official Gazette n° Special of 04/08/2023",
"also determines their number,",
"boundaries and structures.",
"Article 6: Decentralisation",
"(1) Public powers are decentralised to",
"local administrative entities in",
"accordance with legal provisions.",
"(2) A law determines the organisation",
"and functioning of decentralised",
"entities.",
"Article 7: Capital city",
"(1) The capital city of the Republic of",
"Rwanda is the City of Kigali.",
"(2) A law determines the organisation",
"and functioning of the capital city.",
"(3) A law may relocate the Capital city",
"to any other location in Rwanda."
],
"fr": [
"CHAPITRE",
"PREMIER",
":",
"SOUVERAINETÉ",
"DU",
"PEUPLE",
"RWANDAIS ET SUPRÉMATIE DE LA",
"CONSTITUTION",
"Article premier: Source de la souveraineté",
"nationale",
"(1) Tout pouvoir émane du peuple",
"rwandais et s’exerce conformément à",
"la présente Constitution.",
"(2) Aucun individu ni aucun groupe",
"d’individus ne peut s’attribuer",
"l’exercice de la souveraineté",
"nationale.",
"(3) La souveraineté nationale appartient",
"au peuple rwandais qui l’exerce luimême par voie référendaire,",
"électorale ordinaire ou par ses",
"représentants.",
"Article 2: Suffrage",
"(1) Le suffrage est universel et égal pour",
"tous les Rwandais.",
"(2) Tous les Rwandais, femmes et",
"hommes, remplissant les conditions",
"légales, ont le droit de vote et",
"d’éligibilité.",
"(3) Le suffrage est direct ou indirect et",
"secret sauf dans les cas où la présente",
"Constitution ou d’autres lois en",
"disposent autrement.",
"(4) Une loi organique régissant les",
"élections détermine les conditions et",
"les modalités de tenue des élections.",
"Article 3: Suprématie de la Constitution",
"(1) La Constitution est la loi suprême du",
"pays.",
"(2) Une loi, une décision ou un acte",
"contraire à la présente Constitution",
"est sans effet.",
"CHAPITRE",
"RWANDA",
"II:",
"RÉPUBLIQUE",
"DU",
"Article 4: La République",
"(1) L’État rwandais est une République",
"indépendante,",
"souveraine,",
"démocratique, sociale et laïque.",
"(2) Le principe fondateur de la",
"République du Rwanda est : « le",
"gouvernement du peuple rwandais,",
"par le peuple rwandais et pour le",
"peuple rwandais».",
"Article 5: Territoire du Rwanda et entités",
"administratives",
"(1) Le territoire du Rwanda comprend",
"l’espace terrestre, fluvial, lacustre et",
"aérien situé à l’intérieur des frontières",
"de la République du Rwanda.",
"(2) Pour la détermination du territoire",
"rwandais, il est tenu compte des",
"frontières définies par les traités",
"internationaux ratifiés par le Rwanda",
"et les lois rwandaises.",
"(3) Le territoire du Rwanda est divisé en",
"entités administratives déterminées",
"par une loi organique qui en",
"détermine également le nombre, les",
"limites et les structures.",
"Article 6: Décentralisation",
"(1) Les",
"pouvoirs",
"publics",
"sont",
"décentralisés au profit des entités",
"administratives",
"locales",
"conformément aux dispositions",
"légales.",
"(2) Une loi détermine l’organisation et le",
"fonctionnement",
"des",
"entités",
"décentralisées.",
"Article 7: Capitale",
"(1) La capitale de la République du",
"Rwanda est la Ville de Kigali.",
"(2) Une loi détermine l’organisation et le",
"fonctionnement de la capitale.",
"(3) Une loi peut transférer la capitale en",
"tout autre lieu du territoire national."
],
